        "TileImage": "$($repository 64c391f7-4765-48b6-96bc-df8aa5a4186b).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47\rYour destination is the Sanguine fashion show in Paris, France.  Your target is Sanguine designer Sebastian Sato. Sato works as the head stylist alongside his business partner and head of the fashion show, Viktor Novikov. However, Sato and Novikov&apos;s partnership has become more and more unstable, with Sato threatening to expose Novikov when he goes on stage tonight and sink the entire Sanguine enterprise. Novikov has asked us to protect Sanguine and eliminate Sato.  Good luck, 47",
